2 097 152 éléments avec 40 threads ; ce sont des mesures, pas une comparaison avec une variante non-SIMD.", "evidence_ids": ["6ffd5d83eb5045bc"]}, {"claim": "Un développement antérieur a échoué à la compilation ; un autre a été marqué correct, sans mesure de performance publiée.", "evidence_ids": ["6ffd5d83eb5045bc-h01", "6ffd5d83eb5045bc-h02"]}], "read": {"evidence_id": "", "offset": 0, "operation": "none", "path": ""}, "uncertainties": ["La page d’évidence suivante (offset 12000), notamment la fin des détails de l’essai, n’a pas été consultée ; l’attribution précise du gain à la vectorisation et les détails d’implémentation restent donc incertains.", "Pas de résultat de confirmation indépendante ni de comparaison directe au baseline dans les éléments visibles. Une expérience utile serait de comparer, sur les mêmes entrées et budgets de threads, le temps d’appel complet de cette variante et du baseline, en gardant génération des puissances et rollback inchangés ; arrêter si le gain n’est pas reproductible ou si la correction varie sur les graines de confirmation."]}, "report_id": "active-analyst-6df793d9b60649a0a8750c4e0d03fe45", "status": "complete", "watermark": ["6ffd5d83eb5045bc"]}}, "memory": {"schema": "hpc-forest-memory-v1", "enabled": true, "scope": {"epoch": 1, "protocol_id": "cbfb9198c27699b03b580064f2c92a1167e56e51e70234c3a39b58b239f7b244", "tree_id": null}, "page": {"schema": "hpc-forest-memory-v1", "items": [{"id": "1e97ac568500465d", "kind": "experiment", "role": "G", "tree_id": "e1:G-merge-2-1", "mission_id": "1e97ac568500465d", "facts": {"commit": "3fdd9abc8f660e5621393aecc79c203baf4490bf", "base_commit": "bc49abe6067aa29e9f261d8604661495faf6993b", "parent_id": null, "source_ids": ["600ed5dcd12b4666"], "source_count": 1, "source_change": {"available": true, "kind": "nonconfiguration_files_changed", "changed_file_count": 1, "configuration_file_count": 0, "semantic_novelty": "not_established_by_file_hashes", "identical_input_ids": [], "identical_input_count": 0}}, "measured_outcome": {"status": "valid", "correct": true, "mean_seconds": 0.018706013637078005, "score": 0.9543409142560424}, "diagnostic": "", "model_interpretation": {"claim": "Interleaving the two terminal-power recurrences may reduce loop and SIMD-dispatch overhead while preserving each direction's multiplication order and all payoff indices. Whether this improves the full call remains to be measured.", "transformations": "{"files":["src/candidate.cpp"],"retained":["Based on the valid measured G source, retaining its lane-contiguous batches, thread-budget-aware outer parallelism, double-precision powers, and hoisted rollback coefficients.","Interleave positive- and negative-exponent recurrence updates in one lane-SIMD loop, retaining each direction's multiplication order and the full j=0..63 exponent mapping."]}", "applicability": "", "next_experiment": "", "evidence_ids": []}, "source_available": true, "details_are_bounded": true}, {"id": "90b739a8b59c4b0e", "kind": "experiment", "role": "Gm1", "tree_id": "e1:Gm1", "mission_id": "90b739a8b59c4b0e", "facts": {"commit": "05672dd3fb6f3eb2145eed75a7df410b313d2f13", "base_commit": "44f7ab510902eb9c9ca1d7a34fefb8db0505d525", "parent_id": null, "source_ids": ["b9f90f30f9684579", "6ffd5d83eb5045bc"], "source_count": 2, "source_change": {"available": true, "kind": "nonconfiguration_files_changed", "changed_file_count": 1, "configuration_file_count": 0, "semantic_novelty": "not_established_by_file_hashes", "identical_input_ids": [], "identical_input_count": 0}}, "measured_outcome": {"status": "valid", "correct": true, "mean_seconds": 0.037431956934238335, "score": 0.9126268128430617}, "diagnostic": "", "model_interpretation": {"claim": "Combiner le parallélisme externe borné de T1 avec les lots SIMD de huit options indépendantes de T4 peut conserver l’efficacité observée de T1 sur les grands appels tout en vectorisant les calculs de rollback. Les performances ne sont pas supposées additives : T4 seul est plus lent que T1, et seul le protocole officiel peut établir l’effet de leur combinaison.", "transformations": "{"files":["src/candidate.cpp"],"retained":["Conservé le dispatch parallèle externe de T1, avec workers bornés par le budget fourni et au moins 256 éléments par worker; réparti les lots SIMD plutôt que les éléments individuels.","Adapté le traitement SIMD de T4 en lots de huit options avec stockage lane-contiguous et directives OpenMP SIMD pour l’initialisation, les payoffs terminaux, le rollback et les stores; traité aussi les lots incomplets."]}", "applicability": "", "next_experiment": "", "evidence_ids": []}, "source_available": true, "details_are_bounded": true}, {"id": "65b8f9b9574545c1", "kind": "experiment", "role": "T1", "tree_id": "e1:T1", "mission_id": "65b8f9b9574545c1", "facts": {"commit": "e62c55ddd46704700ec0ec5a5ebbdb80ef7abaf2", "base_commit": "9cf372347d35e0d5463d3211b451a73e7b657be6", "parent_id": null, "source_ids": [], "source_count": 0, "source_change": {"available": true, "kind": "nonconfiguration_files_changed", "changed_file_count": 1, "configuration_file_count": 0, "semantic_novelty": "not_established_by_file_hashes", "identical_input_ids": [], "identical_input_count": 0}}, "measured_outcome": {"status": "valid", "correct": true, "mean_seconds": 0.07192095722775113, "score": 0.8446308408045907}, "diagnostic": "", "model_interpretation": {"claim": "The prior valid static-worksharing candidate with a 256-element-per-worker dispatch threshold measured 0.071596 seconds; direct contiguous ranges at that threshold measured 0.072476 seconds. Those whole-call measurements are close and do not establish the scheduler as the cause. This contrasting candidate keeps static scheduling but lowers the per-worker threshold to 64, testing whether parallelizing n=128 with two workers (while keeping n=16 serial) amortizes dispatch overhead; worker count remains bounded by the supplied threads budget. The new candidate is unmeasured.", "transformations":